swot Regional Rollout of the Offline-First Field Inspection App

// stress: long-labels — bullets of 80–110 characters under each quadrant

strengths
  Inspectors can complete a full site visit with no signal and sync automatically when they return to coverage
  The photo annotation tools were built with the safety team and match the paper checklists they replace
weaknesses
  Conflict resolution when two inspectors edit the same asset offline is still manual and takes support staff to resolve
  Only the three largest tablet models have been tested against the sixty-day battery and storage targets
opportunities
  Two municipal water authorities have asked to run a pilot if we can export reports in their regulatory template format
  A partnership with the equipment vendor would put the app on every new device before it leaves the warehouse
threats
  The incumbent vendor has announced a free tier aimed squarely at contractors with fewer than ten inspectors
  New data residency rules in two target regions may require storing synced records on in-country servers by next year
